--- Spatial terrain chunk representing an individual zone tile within Kenshi's continuous 64x64 world grid. Manages heightmap data, PhysX collision sectors, multi-layer biome textures, scent tracking, and dynamic actor population. Coordinates directly with [`ZoneManager`](zonemanager.md) for master grid paging, [`ZoneMapContent`](zonemapcontent.md) for chunk entity instances, [`ZoneSmell`](zonesmell.md) for predator scent trails, and [`MapFeatureList`](mapfeaturelist.md) for static geographical landmarks.
---@class ZoneMap
--- Checks if another chunk shares the same connected island identifier.
---@field isInIsland fun(self: ZoneMap, other: ZoneMap): boolean
--- Initializes internal chunk subsystems, checking disk cache presence, initializing scent trails, and configuring background load queues.
---@field initialise fun(self: ZoneMap)
--- Worker thread update tick: loads terrain heightmaps from disk, deserializes static meshes, and processes procedural foliage.
---@field threadedUpdate fun(self: ZoneMap)
--- Main thread update tick: consumes messages from the worker thread, updates deactivation countdown timers, and commits loaded scene nodes.
---@field update fun(self: ZoneMap): boolean
--- Evaluates world biome partition map for this sector and populates list of active biome records intersecting the chunk.
---@field selectBiomes fun(self: ZoneMap): integer
--- Retrieves the number of unique biomes intersecting this chunk.
---@field getBiomeCount fun(self: ZoneMap): integer
--- Retrieves FCS `GameData` template record for the biome at specified index.
---@field getBiomeData fun(self: ZoneMap, i: integer): GameData
--- Retrieves pointer to `ZoneMapOverlay` managing terrain splatmap textures and multi-layer blending.
---@field getOverlay fun(self: ZoneMap): lightuserdata
--- Retrieves pointer to high-level `AreaSector` geographical partition.
---@field getAreaSector fun(self: ZoneMap): lightuserdata
--- Samples terrain elevation at specified horizontal (X, Y) world coordinates.
---@field getTerrainHeight fun(self: ZoneMap, _x: number, _y: number): number
--- Samples terrain elevation and calculates surface normal vector at given horizontal coordinates.
---@field getTerrainHeightWithNormal fun(self: ZoneMap, _x: number, _y: number, normal: table): number
--- Computes terrain incline slope angle at specified horizontal coordinates.
---@field getTerrainSlope fun(self: ZoneMap, _x: number, _y: number): number
--- Tests whether a 3D world position falls within chunk boundaries, excluding border margins bordering unloaded neighbor chunks.
---@field isWithinBoundsMinusUnloadedEdges fun(self: ZoneMap, borderThickness: number, v: table): boolean
--- Calculates 3D spatial position of the north-west origin corner of the chunk in world units.
---@field getCornerPos fun(self: ZoneMap): table
--- Retrieves the PhysX `TerrainSector` collision mesh instance, optionally forcing construction if unallocated.
---@field getTerrainSector fun(self: ZoneMap, force?: boolean): lightuserdata
--- Queries whether the chunk is currently active in the world simulation.
---@field isActive fun(self: ZoneMap): boolean
--- Returns remaining deactivation countdown timer in seconds before chunk unloads.
---@field getDeactivationCountdown fun(self: ZoneMap): number
--- Checks whether the background worker thread has finished loading chunk assets.
---@field isLoadedBT fun(self: ZoneMap): boolean
--- Checks whether the background worker thread is currently loading assets for this chunk.
---@field isBeingLoadedBT fun(self: ZoneMap): boolean
--- Queries whether the main thread has fully integrated and finalized the loaded chunk.
---@field isLoadedMT fun(self: ZoneMap): boolean
--- Queries whether the main thread is currently awaiting background load completion.
---@field isBeingLoadedMT fun(self: ZoneMap): boolean
--- Tests whether the specified chunk is an immediate neighbor in the 8-direction adjacency neighborhood.
---@field isANeighbour fun(self: ZoneMap, who: ZoneMap): boolean
--- Queries whether PhysX collision geometry for this terrain sector is resident in memory.
---@field isTerrainCollisionLoaded fun(self: ZoneMap): boolean
--- Verifies heightmap data buffer is loaded, triggering synchronous load if missing.
---@field _makeSureTerrainHeightmapLoaded fun(self: ZoneMap)
--- Deactivates chunk on the main thread, unloading dynamic actors, saving modified chunk state if requested, and releasing physics collision shapes.
---@field _dactivateMT fun(self: ZoneMap, saveZoneState?: boolean)
--- Requests NavMesh generator task to reconstruct navigation tile polygons across chunk terrain and structures.
---@field generateNavMeshes fun(self: ZoneMap): boolean
--- Refreshes building entry and usage nodes for all structural entities located within this chunk.
---@field updateBuildingUsageNodes fun(self: ZoneMap)
--- Retrieves 2D horizontal boundary coordinates of the chunk as a vector (minX, minY, maxX, maxY).
---@field getBounds fun(self: ZoneMap): table
