---@field getBoundsMinusUnloadedEdges fun(self: ZoneMap, borderThickness: number): table
--- Traverses connected active neighbor chunks recursively to populate list of all chunks belonging to the same continuous active island.
---@field getActiveZoneIsland fun(self: ZoneMap): ZoneMap[]
