--- Motor controller and physical action execution layer in Kenshi. Embedded within `Character`. Bridges high-level AI decisions (`OrdersReceiver` and `Tasker`) to the physical game world by dispatching animations (`AnimationClass`), driving navmesh locomotion and crowd steering (`CharMovement`), triggering tactical combat actions (`CombatClassAI`), and managing atomic task lifecycles.
---@class CharBody
--- Retrieves the sovereign political faction governing parent character.
---@field getFaction fun(self: CharBody): Faction|nil
--- Virtual per-frame motor update tick. Validates platoon assignment, synchronizes active action subject on the platoon blackboard, caches `frameTIME`, evaluates ragdoll state versus motorized locomotion, executes active `Tasker::runAction`, and triggers task completion or failure transitions.
---@field update fun(self: CharBody, _time: number)
--- Override dispatch for `update`. Virtual per-frame motor update tick. Validates platoon assignment, synchronizes active action subject on the platoon blackboard, caches `frameTIME`, evaluates ragdoll state versus motorized locomotion, executes active `Tasker::runAction`, and triggers task completion or failure transitions.
---@field _NV_update fun(self: CharBody, _time: number)
--- Periodic low-frequency motor and combat update tick. Forwards execution directly into `CombatClass::periodicUpdate()` to refresh weapon ranges, attack slot reservations, and sensory combat awareness.
---@field periodicUpdate fun(self: CharBody, time: number)
--- Dispatches notification to `AITaskSystem` signaling that the physical motor component of the current task has concluded.
---@field notifyBodyTaskComplete fun(self: CharBody)
--- Virtual notification dispatched when an action completes successfully. Signals `AITaskSystem` to advance high-level task queue progression.
---@field notifyTaskComplete fun(self: CharBody)
