--- Master game world simulation coordinator. Manages global game databases (gamedata, leveldata, savedata), physics, audio, root object factories, active mod lists, frame speeds, simulation pause states, system messages, and entity destruction queues. Interacts directly with [`GameDataManager`](gamedatamanager.md) for FCS template assets and world state storage, [`RootObjectFactory`](rootobjectfactory.md) for entity instantiation, [`FactionManager`](factionmanager.md) for diplomatic alignments and warfare, [`NavMesh`](navmesh.md) for terrain pathfinding geometry, [`ZoneManager`](zonemanager.md) for spatial world chunk paging, and [`PlayerInterface`](playerinterface.md) for human player commands.
---@class GameWorld
