--- Master GUI manager coordinating the MyGUI rendering framework, viewport scaling, mouse cursor states, main HUD bars, floating window lifecycles, and context menus. Interacts directly with [`MainBarGUI`](mainbargui.md) for bottom HUD control bars and portraits, [`InventoryGUI`](inventorygui.md) for character, container, and shop barter layouts, [`DatapanelGUI`](datapanelgui.md) for character and building telemetry readouts, [`ToolTip`](tooltip.md) for hovering item inspections, [`CharacterEditWindow`](charactereditwindow.md) for character creation morphs, and [`ScreenLabelInterface`](screenlabelinterface.md) for 3D floating damage and dialogue labels.
