--- Political superstructure governing diplomatic reputation scores, sovereign territorial biomes, military squad rosters, law enforcement alliances, economic trade cultures, and war campaigns. Interacts directly with [`FactionManager`](factionmanager.md) for global faction registration, [`Platoon`](platoon.md) for military and civilian squad simulation, [`Character`](character.md) for individual entity allegiance, [`FactionRelations`](factionrelations.md) for pairwise diplomatic standings, [`FactionWarMgr`](factionwarmgr.md) for military assaults, [`TradeCulture`](tradeculture.md) for contraband and tariffs, and [`FactionLeader`](factionleader.md) for political leadership hierarchies.
