--- Macro military and civilian squad controller governing group formation navigation, roster management, squad AI tasks, patrol waypoints, persistent serialization, and asset ownership. Derived from [`RootObjectBase`](rootobject.md), `Platoon` bridges active 3D world reality and abstract background simulation. Coordinates directly with [`Faction`](faction.md) for political allegiance, [`Character`](character.md) for individual squad members, [`ActivePlatoon`](activeplatoon.md) for live scene graph entities, [`Ownerships`](ownerships.md) for squad currency and property ledgers, and [`TownBase`](townbase.md) for municipal settlement assignments.
