--- Master container and item lifecycle coordinator governing multi-section 2D item grids, equipment paperdoll slots, automated item arrangement, container weight multipliers, encumbrance recalculations, currency transactions, theft status validation, and savegame serialization. Interacts directly with [`InventorySection`](inventorysection.md) for spatial slot arrays, [`Item`](item.md) for concrete physical objects, [`Character`](character.md) for personal equipment, and [`ShopTrader`](shoptrader.md) for mercantile inventories.
---@class Inventory
