--- Discrete 2D spatial inventory container grid managing item tile placement, cell occupancy bitmaps, equipment slot validation, stack bonuses, backpack weight reductions, and event callbacks. Each `InventorySection` belongs to a parent [`Inventory`](inventory.md) instance and coordinates directly with [`Item`](item.md) instances, [`Character`](character.md) equipment slots, and [`RaceLimiter`](racelimiter.md) gear restriction rules.
---@class InventorySection
--- Evaluates whether an item blueprint can fit into this section, verifying stack merging potential against existing items and scanning vacant grid cells if stack merging cannot absorb the quantity.
---@field hasRoomForItem fun(self: InventorySection, _itemData: GameData, quantity: integer): boolean
--- Override dispatch for `hasRoomForItem`. Evaluates whether an item blueprint can fit into this section, verifying stack merging potential against existing items and scanning vacant grid cells if stack merging cannot absorb the quantity.
---@field _NV_hasRoomForItem fun(self: InventorySection, _itemData: GameData, quantity: integer): boolean
--- Clears parent inventory fit lookup caches and notifies parent inventory of structural modifications.
---@field notifyModified fun(self: InventorySection)
