--- Universal object-relational data model record for the Kenshi engine and Forgotten Construction Set (FCS). Encapsulates typed primitive dictionaries (bool, int, float, string, file, vector, quaternion), ordered references with integer triplet values, world placement instances, dirty tracking for mod stack layering, and binary/text disk persistence. Interacts directly with [`GameDataContainer`](gamedatacontainer.md) for master mod record ownership, [`GameDataManager`](gamedatamanager.md) for active file mod stacking, and [`RootObjectFactory`](rootobjectfactory.md) for converting data templates into live game objects.
---@class GameData
