---@field _addToKillList fun(data: GameData)
--- Next sequential unique integer ID to allocate (`0x008`–`0x00C`).
---@field currentID integer
--- File path or mod name string associated with container (`0x150`–`0x178`).
---@field name string
--- Flag indicating container holds base game data (`0x178`).
---@field isBaseDatafile boolean
--- Write protection toggle flag preventing record edits (`0x179`).
---@field readOnly boolean
--- Integer ID $\rightarrow$ GameData* lookup hash map (`0x050`–`0x090`).
---@field gamedataID OgreUnorderedMap<integer, GameData>
--- String ID $\rightarrow$ GameData* lookup hash map (`0x0D0`–`0x110`).
---@field gamedataSID BoostUnorderedMap<string, GameData>
--- Flat master hash set of all managed GameData records (`0x110`–`0x150`).
---@field mainList OgreUnorderedSet<GameData>

