--- Base visual appearance and 3D mesh deformation controller for all characters and creatures in Kenshi. Manages skeletal bone morphing, slider-driven body proportions (`GameDataCopyStandalone*`), equipment and weapon slot attachments (`AttachedEntity`), embedded projectile harpoons, bleeding wound decals (`Wound*`), dynamic blood and wetness shaders, and UI portrait rendering generation.
---@class AppearanceBase
