--- Primary entity actor representing all humanoid and creature characters across the game world. Coordinates AI execution, combat, movement, anatomical damage, inventories, equipment, physics ragdolls, perception, and dialogues. Interacts directly with [`MedicalSystem`](medicalsystem.md) for anatomical limb damage and vital hitpoints, [`CharStats`](charstats.md) for attributes and skill calculations, [`AI`](ai.md) for Goal-Oriented Action Planning and jobs, [`CombatClass`](combatclass.md) for melee combat execution, [`RangedCombatClass`](rangedcombatclass.md) for crossbow targeting, [`Inventory`](inventory.md) for equipment slots and items, [`CharMovement`](charmovement.md) for locomotion pathfinding, [`CharBody`](charbody.md) for visual mesh and detached limbs, and [`Platoon`](platoon.md) for squad membership and command structures.
