--- Master architectural and structural simulation entity representing buildings, outposts, town gates, defensive walls, manufacturing facilities, and interior furniture items. Manages construction material delivery, construction progress tracking, structural dismantling, town ownership, power grid connectivity, Havok navmesh cutouts, PhysX collision hulls, Ogre3D scene node hierarchies, positional audio emitters, interior visibility culling, and character job/usage interaction nodes. Interacts directly with [`Town`](town.md) for settlement ownership, [`TownBuildingsManager`](townbuildingsmanager.md) for municipal infrastructure, [`BuildingInterior`](buildinginterior.md) for interior furniture layouts, [`DoorStuff`](doorstuff.md) for gateway/door security, [`UsageNode`](usagenode.md) for worker and craft station bindings, and child specializations ([`UseableStuff`](useablestuff.md), [`StorageBuilding`](storagebuilding.md), [`ProductionBuilding`](productionbuilding.md), [`CraftingBuilding`](craftingbuilding.md), [`FarmBuilding`](farmbuilding.md), [`WallBuilding`](wallbuilding.md), [`GatewayBuilding`](gatewaybuilding.md)).
