--- Base settlement entity representing villages, ruins, creature nests, and bandit camps. Coordinates territorial coverage, resident populations, faction ownership, and town alert levels. Interacts directly with [`TownBuildingsManager`](townbuildingsmanager.md) for town infrastructure and structural building registration, [`BasePopulationManager`](basepopulationmanager.md) for squad spawning and resident counts, [`ZoneMap`](zonemap.md) for spatial terrain chunk coverage, [`NestBatcher`](nestbatcher.md) for procedural creature nest geometry, and [`Faction`](faction.md) for diplomatic alignments and town ownership.
---@class TownBase : RootObject
