--- Attribute, combat skill, racial bonus, damage curve, and experience points (XP) calculation engine for `Character` actors. Manages primary attributes (Strength, Dexterity, Toughness, Perception) and secondary proficiencies (Martial Arts, Melee Attack/Defence, Weapon proficiencies, Athletics, Stealth, Thievery, Crafting, Medicine, Crossbows, and Turrets). Governs movement dynamics (run speed, encumbrance penalties, swim speed, stealth speed), combat speed (attack/block timing, weapon weight penalties), damage scaling (cut, blunt, pierce, bleed), environmental weather hazard protection, and experience event dispatching. Coordinates directly with [`Character`](character.md) for entity state, [`MedicalSystem`](medicalsystem.md) for health and wound penalties, [`Inventory`](inventory.md) for weight encumbrance, and [`CombatClass`](combatclass.md) for attack selection and damage resolution.
---@class CharStats
