--- Tactical combat slot arbiter managing simultaneous melee engagement reservations around a defender. Enforces engine attack slot limits (vanilla default of 1 simultaneous attacker, moddable up to 5 via `MAX_NUM_ATTACK_SLOTS`), queues surplus attackers into waiting and circling states, detects slot timeouts, and notifies queued opponents via `informOfFreeAttackSlot` when slots become vacant.
---@class AttackSlotManager
--- Checks whether there is at least one unassigned attack slot available under the active slot limit (`getNumAttackSlots`).
---@field hasFreeAttackSlot fun(self: AttackSlotManager): boolean
--- Releases the attack slot held by the specified attacker handle, clearing handle data and resetting the occupancy timer.
---@field freeSlotH fun(self: AttackSlotManager, who: hand)
--- Clears all 5 attack slots, releasing all reserved attacker handles and zeroing timers.
---@field freeAllSlotsH fun(self: AttackSlotManager)
--- Claims an open attack slot for the requesting attacker handle. If the attacker already holds a slot, returns true; otherwise assigns the first vacant slot.
---@field addToSlotH fun(self: AttackSlotManager, who: hand): boolean
--- Low-frequency update loop. Increments slot timers, detects dead or incapacitated attackers, frees abandoned slots, and notifies queued opponents via `informOfFreeAttackSlot`.
---@field periodicUpdate fun(self: AttackSlotManager, time: number)
--- Per-frame tick hook for attack slot adjustments.
---@field update fun(self: AttackSlotManager)
--- Calculates the effective maximum number of simultaneous attackers allowed against this defender, taking into account global constants, race bonuses, and passive states.
---@field getNumAttackSlots fun(self: AttackSlotManager): integer
--- Retrieves the engine-wide global upper bound for attack slots from `g_globalConstants.MAX_NUM_ATTACK_SLOTS`.
---@field getMaxPossibleAttackSlots fun(self: AttackSlotManager): integer
--- Fixed array of 5 engagement slot entries ($5 \times \text{0x28} = \text{0xC8}$ bytes: `0x010`–`0x0D8`), each holding attacker handle `who` and occupancy timer `time`.
---@field attackSlotH number|table
--- Parent combat coordinator controlling state machine transitions.
---@field combatClass CombatClass
--- Owner character whose immediate combat perimeter is governed by this slot manager.
---@field me Character

