--- Law enforcement, criminal offense, and judicial bounty manager in Kenshi. Embedded within `Character::crimes` at offset `0xF0`. Manages active faction bounties (`bounties`), witnessed criminal infractions (`committingCrime`, `crimeExpiry`), sovereign law-enforcement delegation (`_getBountyFaction`), temporary access authorizations (`_hasAccessPass`, `accessPassExpirationTime`), judicial incarceration sentencing (`prisonSentenceToServe`, `prisonSentenceBeganTime`), and police visual recognition thresholds (`getBountyRecognitionThreshold`).
---@class BountyManager
--- Iterates across all active bounties issued against this character, returning the faction that has posted the highest bounty reward.
---@field _getHighestBountyFaction fun(self: BountyManager): Faction
--- Queries the minimum bounty threshold required for guards and police to actively identify and attack or arrest this character on sight (typically 10,000 Cats).
---@field getBountyRecognitionThreshold fun(self: BountyManager): integer
--- Calculates the sum total of all active bounties across all factions currently wanted on this character.
---@field getTotalBounty fun(self: BountyManager): integer
--- Per-frame simulation update step. Advances crime expiration timers, checks natural bounty degradation, updates prison sentence progress, and expires temporary access passes.
---@field update fun(self: BountyManager, frameTime: number)
--- Formats a user-facing string detailing time remaining until active bounty expires, or 'Never' if permanent.
---@field getBountyExpiryStringForGUI fun(self: BountyManager): string
--- Extends or refreshes potential crime suspicion timer when character is caught performing suspicious acts in guard line of sight.
---@field notifyPossibleCrimeWitnessed fun(self: BountyManager, time: number)
--- Queries whether character is currently engaged in an active, ongoing criminal act (`committingCrime != NO_CRIME`).
---@field isCommittingCrime fun(self: BountyManager): boolean
--- Resolves the governing law-enforcement faction associated with faction `f`, mapping subordinate or allied factions to their parent sovereign authority.
---@field _getBountyFaction fun(self: BountyManager, f: Faction): Faction
--- Calculates the perceived bounty value of this character from the perspective of an observing character (`whosLooking`), accounting for disguise effectiveness, faction allegiances, and recognition distance.
---@field getPercievedBounty fun(self: BountyManager, whosLooking: Character): integer
--- Returns the exact actual numerical bounty value currently registered against this character by faction `whosLooking`.
---@field getActualBounty fun(self: BountyManager, whosLooking: Faction): integer
--- Records that the player character faction has turned in this wanted outlaw to faction `whosLooking`, awarding reward Cats and flagging bounty as claimed.
---@field notifyPlayerClaimBounty fun(self: BountyManager, whosLooking: Faction)
--- Queries whether the player faction has already claimed the bounty reward for this character from faction `whosLooking`, preventing duplicate rewards.
---@field bountyAlreadyBeenClaimedByPlayer fun(self: BountyManager, whosLooking: Faction): boolean
--- Converts ongoing witnessed crimes into an official registered bounty under law-enforcement faction `enforcer`.
---@field assignBountyForCrimes fun(self: BountyManager, enforcer: Faction)
--- Directly adds an arbitrary numerical penalty amount to the bounty issued by `enforcer` (e.g. scripted events or illegal smuggling bribes).
---@field unfairAddToBounty fun(self: BountyManager, enforcer: Faction, amount: integer)
--- Clears and forgives all criminal charges and bounty penalties issued by faction `enforcer` (e.g. after sentence completion, pacifier bribery, or expiration).
---@field clearBounty fun(self: BountyManager, enforcer: Faction)
--- Deserializes faction bounties, criminal charges, prison sentence timers, and temporary access passes from a `GameData* state` record during game loading.
---@field load fun(self: BountyManager, state: GameData)
--- Serializes active bounties, committed crimes, remaining incarceration sentence durations, and access pass timestamps into `GameData* state` for save games.
---@field save fun(self: BountyManager, state: GameData)
--- Sets active ongoing crime state on character (e.g. lockpicking, stealing, trespassing, assault), recording the victim faction and victim entity handle.
---@field setCrime fun(self: BountyManager, crime: integer, against: Faction, agnst: hand): boolean
--- Triggered when an NPC witnesses this character committing a crime. Sets expiry duration, alerts nearby guards, and registers criminal offense.
---@field notifyCrimeWitnessed fun(self: BountyManager, against: Faction, againstWho: hand, expirytime: integer, what: integer)
--- Commences a formal prison sentence under law-enforcement faction `law`. Locks character into prison cage, calculates required sentence hours from bounty, and records sentence start timestamp.
---@field notifyStartPrisonSentence fun(self: BountyManager, law: Faction)
--- Evaluates whether this character holds an active, unexpired temporary authorized access pass granted by faction `forFac` (e.g. visiting nobility or holy nation clearances).
---@field hasAccessPass fun(self: BountyManager, forFac: Faction): boolean
--- Grants a temporary authorized access pass from faction `who` valid for `minutes` in-game time.
---@field giveAccessPass fun(self: BountyManager, who: Faction, minutes: number)
--- Static helper converting a `CrimeEnum` value into a localized user-facing string description for UI display.
---@field crimeToStr fun(self: BountyManager, c: integer): string
--- Static table lookup returning the baseline bounty monetary penalty (in Cats) assigned for a specific crime type.
---@field getBountyForCrime fun(self: BountyManager, c: integer): integer
--- Static calculation deriving required prison incarceration duration in in-game hours from total bounty penalty value.
---@field getPrisonSentenceInHours fun(self: BountyManager, bounty: integer): integer
--- Static calculation determining time in game hours until a low-level bounty naturally expires and drops off.
---@field getBountyExpirationTime fun(self: BountyManager, bounty: integer): number
--- Flag indicating financial bounty was already levied for current crime (`0xA4`).
---@field _hadABountyAssignedForCurrentCrime boolean
--- Faction authority granting temporary access privileges (`0x048`–`0x050`).
---@field _hasAccessPass Faction
--- Expiration timestamp for temporary faction access pass (`0x050`–`0x058`).
---@field accessPassExpirationTime TimeOfDay
--- Faction bounty registry mapping law-enforcement factions to active criminal records (`0x000`–`0x040`).
---@field bounties OgreUnorderedMap<Faction, Bounty>
--- Active criminal offense currently being executed (`0x058`–`0x05C`).
---@field committingCrime integer
--- Target entity handle of victim/property targeted by crime (`0x070`–`0x090`).
---@field crimeAgainst hand
--- Victim faction targeted by active criminal offense (`0x060`–`0x068`).
---@field crimeAgainstFaction Faction
--- Countdown timer in seconds before active witnessed crime state expires (`0x090`–`0x094`).
---@field crimeExpiry number
--- Character entity possessing this bounty manager (`0x040`–`0x048`).
---@field me Character
--- In-game timestamp recording incarceration sentence commencement (`0x098`–`0x0A0`).
---@field prisonSentenceBeganTime TimeOfDay
--- Remaining prison sentence duration in game hours (`0xA0`–`0xA4`).
---@field prisonSentenceToServe number
--- Faction owner of training dummy or facility currently occupied (`0x068`–`0x070`).
---@field usingTrainingEquipmentOf Faction

