--- Plastic surgeon and character creation window. Provides procedural bone scaling sliders, muscle and bulk blend curves, posture options, race/gender selection, and mesh export/import. Coordinates an orbital preview camera ([`CharacterEditCamera`](#)), multi-character squad setups ([`Character`](character.md)), procedural skeletal morph blending, and disk persistence for `.bod2` body preset files.
---@class CharacterEditWindow
--- Per-frame update tick for the character creation screen. Updates orbital camera interpolation, applies pending live character model rebuilds, and animates character idle stance.
---@field update fun(self: CharacterEditWindow)
--- Loads race templates, sub-race definitions, mesh attachment lists, and morph slider definitions from game data.
---@field loadData fun(self: CharacterEditWindow)
--- Initializes editable character array, populating default appearance records, cached poses, and initial positions for all squad members participating in new game setup.
---@field initCharacters fun(self: CharacterEditWindow)
--- Applies race and sub-race changes to the active character, rebuilding skeletal meshes, swapping base textures, updating race lore description, and synchronizing stat preview panels.
---@field updateRace fun(self: CharacterEditWindow)
--- Updates and blends all skeletal vertex poses across the character mesh based on current posture slider values.
---@field updateCharacterPoses fun(self: CharacterEditWindow)
--- Clears and resets all active vertex poses and posture animation tracks on the preview character.
---@field clearCharacterPoses fun(self: CharacterEditWindow)
--- Switches the active character in the 3D preview platform, updating the character index label (`txtCharIdx`) and refreshing all sliders and labels.
---@field updateCharacter fun(self: CharacterEditWindow)
--- Controls visibility of the 3D scene entity for the specified character on the inspection platform.
---@field showCharacter fun(self: CharacterEditWindow, c: Character, on?: boolean)
--- Instantiates and arranges the procedural slider widgets and attachment scrollbars for the currently selected morph category.
---@field updateCurrentCategory fun(self: CharacterEditWindow)
--- Callback executed when the user selects a preset file in the open/save file dialog. Parses the .bod2 file and applies appearance attributes to the active character.
---@field loadImportedCharacter fun(self: CharacterEditWindow, _dialog: OpenSaveFileDialog, accept?: boolean, result: string)
--- Directly controls clothing sub-mesh visibility on the specified character's 3D rendering entity.
---@field setClothesVisible fun(self: CharacterEditWindow, _character: Character, visible?: boolean)
--- Callback dispatched from the confirmation message box when the player confirms or cancels changes in plastic surgeon mode.
---@field confirmMessageCallback fun(self: CharacterEditWindow, _btn: integer)
--- Builds and attaches MyGUI widgets for name input, race cycling buttons, gender toggles, category tabs, and action buttons.
---@field setupUI fun(self: CharacterEditWindow)
--- Enables or disables interactive UI controls during camera transitions, file import/export modal dialogues, or character mesh reloading.
---@field setUIEnabled fun(self: CharacterEditWindow, enabled?: boolean)
--- Synchronizes all UI widget states, slider positions, labels, and text fields with the currently selected character's appearance data.
