--- Master tactical melee combat controller governing realtime weapon exchanges, directional swing trajectories, defensive blocking arcs, damage mitigations, and attack slot reservations. Coordinates directly with [`AnimationClass`](animationclass.md) for skeletal motion, [`CharStats`](charstats.md) for combat formulas and weapon skills, [`MedicalSystem`](medicalsystem.md) for anatomical trauma, and [`CharMovement`](movement.md) for combat spacing.
