--- Main HUD bottom control bar managing squad portraits, simulation speed controls, time and currency readouts, floor level selectors, and orders toggles. Orchestrates interactive portrait item boxes across squad tabs ([`MainTabPortraitPlatoon`](#)), contextual inspection datapanels ([`DatapanelGUI`](datapanelgui.md)), vital limb health displays ([`MedicalDatapanel`](#)), and GOAP task stance selectors ([`OrdersPanel`](#)).
---@class MainBarGUI
