---@class MyGUI

--- Master navigation system integrating Havok AI (hkaiWorld). Manages asynchronous pathfinding queries, outdoor terrain sectors, interior building NavMesh instances, door traversal gates, and origin shifts. Interacts directly with [`HavokCharacter`](havokcharacter.md) for character agent path following, [`ZoneMap`](zonemap.md) for outdoor terrain tile streaming, [`Building`](building.md) for interior navigational cutouts and door states, and [`ThreadClass`](threadclass.md) for dedicated background multi-threaded path calculation.
