--- Specialized municipal settlement controller governing electrical power grids, generator output, battery storage reserves, defensive perimeter gates, public commerce policies, commodity trade price modifiers, and outpost progression tiers. Derived from [`TownBase`](townbase.md), `Town` interacts directly with [`GameData`](gamedata.md) for FCS settlement and resident records, [`UseableStuff`](useablestuff.md) for electrical machinery and generators, [`GatewayBuilding`](gatewaybuilding.md) for perimeter access gates, [`AlarmManager`](alarmmanager.md) for emergency alert states, [`DatapanelGUI`](datapanelgui.md) for inspector telemetry, and [`Faction`](faction.md) for municipal diplomatic relationships.
---@class Town
