--- Municipal architectural graphics manager governing building mesh rendering, multi-floor visual slice visibility, commercial signboard fixtures, and OGRE GPU hardware mesh instancing. Coordinates directly with [`TownBase`](townbase.md) and [`Town`](town.md) for settlement ownership, [`Building`](building.md) for architectural hierarchy, and [`DatapanelGUI`](datapanelgui.md) for camera floor-slicing controls.
---@class TownBuildingsManager
--- Flushes all registered building entity records, signposts, and hardware instancing allocations when resetting or unloading town assets.
---@field clear fun(self: TownBuildingsManager)
--- Transfers all registered building graphic entities, multi-floor slices, and instancing managers to another town manager instance during town merge or ownership swap.
---@field moveBuildingsTo fun(self: TownBuildingsManager, to: TownBuildingsManager)
--- Completely removes a building and all its associated multi-floor mesh entities, interior shells, and signs from the manager.
---@field removeBuilding fun(self: TownBuildingsManager, building: Building)
--- Controls camera floor slicing for a building, rendering all floors up to the specified level and hiding upper floors and roofs for interior visibility.
---@field setFloorVisible fun(self: TownBuildingsManager, building: Building, floor: integer)
--- Sets visible floor slicing across all registered buildings in the settlement simultaneously, optionally filtering for player-owned buildings.
---@field setAllVisible fun(self: TownBuildingsManager, floor: integer, onlyPlayerBuildings?: boolean)
--- Resets floor slicing across all buildings to default exterior visibility (all floors and exterior roofs visible).
---@field resetAllVisible fun(self: TownBuildingsManager)
--- Toggles visibility of commercial shop signs, trade guild plaques, and street markers across the settlement.
---@field setSignsVisible fun(self: TownBuildingsManager, value?: boolean)
