--- Mounted defensive weapon station encapsulating [`GunClassTurret`](gunclassturret.md). Governs operator gunnery tracking, horizontal and vertical articulated physics rotation joints, defensive wall elevation advantages, power consumption for electrified harpoons, and ammunition feed cycles. Derived from [`UseableStuff`](useablestuff.md), `TurretBuilding` interacts directly with [`Character`](character.md) for gunnery AI tasks, [`Building`](building.md) and [`WallBuilding`](wallbuilding.md) for parent rampart mounting, and [`TownBuildingsManager`](townbuildingsmanager.md) for settlement defensive spatial registration.
